{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"前一段那种越相信、越迫切索求的劲头在这里忽然松开了，取而代之的是一种暂时失去着力点的游移和陌生感；并不是失望，也没有否定已经得到的满足，只是原先很明确地“还想从这里得到更多”，此刻不再那么理所当然。\",\"thread\":\"前面已经把这份真实的满足推到了很深，也正因为如此，它能给什么、不能给什么开始有了更清楚的边界。尚未安顿的部分仍然在，但继续加深同一种满足，已经不像刚才那样足以成为直接的回答，于是迫切的索求暂时失去了明确对象。人没有理由否认此前所得，却也不能再单纯靠“更多一些”继续向前，这才使此刻既松开了一点，又显得没有着落。\",\"used\":\"第2段已经确认这里确实能给予真实满足；第3段已经分清真实满足与真正安顿需要并不是一回事；第4段曾因此更深地投入，并向已有的满足要求更多。\",\"new\":[\"原先以为尚未满足的部分可以通过把已有满足进一步加深来追求，现在这条路第一次显出了限度。\",\"已有的满足仍然有效，但它不再自然地成为全部需要继续索求的唯一对象。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1efe1beb-0cba-442d-b80a-35fabf203bc7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T220056503411Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.406, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:01:28.921047+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c7505ca55b01c27b7c5985b1a9e66309ae0fad87fee821a82387606bf3fbd348", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg